Renovated 1-Bedroom Apartment on Avenida Infante Santo | Lisbon

1-bedroom apartment, move-in ready, with 39 m², a balcony and storage room, located on the 2nd floor of a building with two elevators, on Avenida Infante Santo.

The apartment features an open-plan living room and fully equipped kitchen, a spacious bedroom with built-in wardrobe and balcony, and a full bathroom with a walk-in shower. It is also equipped with air conditioning, tilt-and-turn double-glazed windows, and electric shutters, providing comfort and energy efficiency throughout the year.

One of the property's main advantages is its location. Avenida Infante Santo places you close to Estrela, Lapa, Alcântara and the Tagus River, with a wide range of shops, services, restaurants, cultural venues and leisure options nearby.

Within the surrounding area, you will find Jardim da Estrela, Tapada das Necessidades, Doca de Alcântara, LX Factory, the National Museum of Ancient Art, the Oriente Museum, the Carris Museum and Estrela Basilica, as well as numerous restaurants, cafés and local shops.

The area is well served by bus and tram, with relatively easy access to Estrela Metro Station and Alcântara's railway stations. Nearby healthcare facilities include CUF Tejo Hospital, CUF Infante Santo Hospital and Egas Moniz Hospital, as well as several schools and colleges.

For those who drive, there is public parking directly on Avenida Infante Santo, right in front of the building.

Important note: the property currently has a commercial/services use licence, and therefore cannot be purchased using conventional residential mortgage financing. The property is consequently primarily suited to cash buyers and investors.

An opportunity for those looking for a renovated, functional and move-in-ready property in a central area of Lisbon, close to the river and surrounded by excellent amenities and transport connections.

